WEBVTT - Class 1 English Mridang Chapter 1: Two Little Hands

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.000
<v Teacher Tara>Welcome children! Look closely at your two little hands. What can they do? They can clap, clap, clap, and make a happy rhythm!

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<v Teacher Tara>Two little feet go tap, tap, tap on the floor! Two little eyes are open wide to see our beautiful world, and one little head nods hello!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:02:15.000
<v Teacher Tara>Before we sit down to eat, our two hands wash with fresh water and gentle soap bubbles. Clean hands keep our tummy happy and strong!

00:02:15.000 --> 00:03:00.000
<v Teacher Tara>Now it is your turn! Say one helpful action your hands can do: "My hands can put my books away!" Splendid work, young scholar!
